"wired thermal imagers:"
msgstr "固件包含 :doc:`/library/omv.fir` 驱动，用于外接的热成像仪："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:643
msgid "**MLX90621** — 16 × 4 IR array"
msgstr "**MLX90621** —— 16 × 4 红外阵列"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:644
msgid "**MLX90640** — 32 × 24 IR array"
msgstr "**MLX90640** —— 32 × 24 红外阵列"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:645
msgid "**MLX90641** — 16 × 12 IR array"
msgstr "**MLX90641** —— 16 × 12 红外阵列"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:646
msgid "**AMG8833** — 8 × 8 IR array"
msgstr "**AMG8833** —— 8 × 8 红外阵列"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:648
msgid ""
"Wire the module to the board's I²C bus and read frames with ``fir.init()`` +"
" ``fir.snapshot()``::"
msgstr "将模块连接到开发板的 I²C 总线，并用 ``fir.init()`` + ``fir.snapshot()`` 读取帧::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:669
